ystem information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable - Linux Mint 22.2 (Zara) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Mobile) - integrated Intel(R) Iris(R) Xe Graphics (TGL GT2) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-1135G7 @ 2.40GHz (8 threads) - 7.40 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen setting ```editable``` to false, selecting some text in the TextEdit and then setting ```editable``` to true, the Caret does not re-appear until the Node is refocused.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Set up basic scene with a TextEdit/CodeEdit and a way to toggle its ```editable``` variable without clicking somewhere else.\n- set ```editable``` to false.\n- select any amount of text in the TextEdit/CodeEdit.\n- set ```editable``` to true.\n\nExpected: Carot shows up like normal.\nActual: Carot is fully invisible, even when typing or moving it with arrow keys.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[codeeditbug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24544086/codeeditbug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/i